            <div class="ut-copy field field--name-body field--type-text-with-summary field--label-hidden field__item"><h1>Affordable Housing in Austin</h1>

<p>Various affordable housing programs are available in Austin and are funded at county, city, state and federal levels.&nbsp;Check out these resources to get information&nbsp;on eligibility&nbsp;and assistance&nbsp;in your search for housing.</p></div>
      
  </div>
<div class="utexas-twocol block-bundle-utexas-flex-content-area block block-layout-builder block-inline-blockutexas-flex-content-area clearfix">
  
    
      
      <div class="ut-flex-content-area-wrapper field field--name-field-block-fca field--type-utexas-flex-content-area field--label-hidden field__items">
              <div class="ut-flex-content-area field__item">
  <div data-ratio="" class="image-wrapper">
        <picture>
                  <source srcset="/sites/default/files/styles/utexas_image_style_900w_600h/public/hero-photos/Apartment3.jpg?itok=puN1EMZT 1x, /sites/default/files/styles/utexas_image_style_1800w_1200h/public/hero-photos/Apartment3.jpg?itok=jJYqTuE2 2x" media="all and (min-width: 900px)" type="image/jpeg" width="900" height="600"/>
              <source srcset="/sites/default/files/styles/utexas_image_style_340w_227h/public/hero-photos/Apartment3.jpg?itok=DsGf7Siv 1x, /sites/default/files/styles/utexas_image_style_680w_454h/public/hero-photos/Apartment3.jpg?itok=P_EcIuCY 2x" media="all and (min-width: 600px) and (max-width: 899px)" type="image/jpeg" width="340" height="227"/>
              <source srcset="/sites/default/files/styles/utexas_image_style_500w_333h/public/hero-photos/Apartment3.jpg?itok=u2EqOoSB 1x, /sites/default/files/styles/utexas_image_style_1800w_1200h/public/hero-photos/Apartment3.jpg?itok=jJYqTuE2 2x" media="all and (max-width: 599px)" type="image/jpeg" width="500" height="333"/>
                  <img class="ut-img--fluid" width="340" height="227" src="/sites/default/files/styles/utexas_image_style_340w_227h/public/hero-photos/Apartment3.jpg?itok=DsGf7Siv" alt="Apartment building, sun in background" loading="lazy" />

  </picture>


  </div>
<div class="content-wrapper">
      <h3 class="ut-headline"><a href="https://www.austintexas.gov/department/affordable-housing-online-search-tool-ahost" class="ut-link--darker">Affordable Housing Online Search Tool</a></h3>
        <div class="ut-copy">
        <p>Check out this map to find income-restricted affordable housing, including SMART Housing, in your area. Tip: in the income section, be sure to reflect what your income is based on things such as loans, financial aid and pay from jobs.&nbsp;</p>
    </div>
      <a href="https://www.austintexas.gov/department/affordable-housing-online-search-tool-ahost" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true" class="ut-btn">Explore the Affordable Housing Online Search Tool</a>
</div>
</div>
              <div class="ut-flex-content-area field__item">
  <div data-ratio="" class="image-wrapper">
        <picture>
                  <source srcset="/sites/default/files/styles/utexas_image_style_900w_600h/public/flex-content-areas/Now%20Leasing.jpg?itok=I-sk-r7k 1x, /sites/default/files/styles/utexas_image_style_1800w_1200h/public/flex-content-areas/Now%20Leasing.jpg?itok=u0cFRW_X 2x" media="all and (min-width: 900px)" type="image/jpeg" width="900" height="600"/>
              <source srcset="/sites/default/files/styles/utexas_image_style_340w_227h/public/flex-content-areas/Now%20Leasing.jpg?itok=edgAYGfK 1x, /sites/default/files/styles/utexas_image_style_680w_454h/public/flex-content-areas/Now%20Leasing.jpg?itok=qnazbZo2 2x" media="all and (min-width: 600px) and (max-width: 899px)" type="image/jpeg" width="340" height="227"/>
              <source srcset="/sites/default/files/styles/utexas_image_style_500w_333h/public/flex-content-areas/Now%20Leasing.jpg?itok=ms7SaRcV 1x, /sites/default/files/styles/utexas_image_style_1800w_1200h/public/flex-content-areas/Now%20Leasing.jpg?itok=u0cFRW_X 2x" media="all and (max-width: 599px)" type="image/jpeg" width="500" height="333"/>
                  <img class="ut-img--fluid" width="340" height="227" src="/sites/default/files/styles/utexas_image_style_340w_227h/public/flex-content-areas/Now%20Leasing.jpg?itok=edgAYGfK" alt="Pop-up sign that reads &quot;Now Leasing&quot;" loading="lazy" />

  </picture>


  </div>
<div class="content-wrapper">
      <h3 class="ut-headline"><a href="https://www.austintexas.gov/page/resources-renters" class="ut-link--darker">Resources for Renters</a></h3>
        <div class="ut-copy">
        <p>Not sure where to start in your affordable housing search? Explore Resources for Renters first to get a sense of what may be available to you.</p>
    </div>
      <a href="https://www.austintexas.gov/page/resources-renters" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true" class="ut-btn">Find Resources for Renters</a>
</div>
</div>
          </div>
  
  </div>

        </div>
      
              <div  class="layout__region layout__region--second">
          <div class="utexas-onecol block-bundle-utexas-promo-unit block block-layout-builder block-inline-blockutexas-promo-unit clearfix">
  
    
      
            <div class="field field--name-field-block-pu field--type-utexas-promo-unit field--label-hidden field__item">
<div class="utexas-promo-unit-container">
  <div class="utexas-promo-unit-items">
      <div class="utexas-promo-unit">
              <div class="image-wrapper landscape-image">
