            <div class="data-wrapper">
                  <h3 class="ut-headline"><a href="https://www.trla.org/atc" class="ut-link--darker">Austin Tenants Council Project</a></h3>
                          <p><span>The project focuses on housing discrimination; tenant-landlord education and information; and housing repair and rehabilitation. Counseling by telephone and appointments available.</span></p>
